      "content": "The only logical reason to fight is that the universe is currently a chaotic, messy place where your pain feels real and your efforts feel like they matter. Since the heat death is so far in the future that it doesn't even exist yet, there is no point in worrying about it now. You are wasting your finite energy on a problem that hasn't happened, so why not just stop fighting and let the universe do its thing?",
